'''Template:OrgDemo''' — sample Cargo table for [[Help:Saintapedia Graph]].

Table name is '''OrgDemo''' (not Organization) so it will not collide with a wiki's own infobox.

Same shape works for archdioceses, dioceses, parishes, religious orders, and foundations: set <code>Type</code> and point <code>ParentOrg</code> at the parent page (empty for a root). On a real wiki, point <code><nowiki>{{Org chart|table=Parishes|parent=Diocese}}</nowiki></code> at your own tables instead of importing this one.

{{#cargo_declare:_table=OrgDemo
|Name=String
|ParentOrg=Page
|Type=String
|Country=String
|Website=URL
}}
</noinclude><includeonly>{{#cargo_store:_table=OrgDemo
|Name={{{Name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}
|ParentOrg={{{ParentOrg|}}}
|Type={{{Type|}}}
|Country={{{Country|}}}
|Website={{{Website|}}}
}}
'''{{{Name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}''' ({{{Type|}}}){{#if:{{{ParentOrg|}}}| — parent: [[{{{ParentOrg}}}]]}}{{#if:{{{Country|}}}| — {{{Country}}}}}
</includeonly>
